{"id": "airport-baggage-maintenance-state-ban", "title": "A state contracting ban disqualified SFO’s highest-scoring baggage contractor", "seconds": 57.4, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "bd81683616515969", "words": 144, "beats": [{"scene": "b", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Three companies bid to maintain baggage systems and airport boarding bridges.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.68, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "scored", "highest?"], "sub": "Three bids at SFO"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.88, 1.12, 1.23, 1.74, 2.16, 2.74, 2.96, 3.46, 3.83]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Before that competition, supervisors cut the incumbent’s spending ceiling by $400,000.", "t0": 4.8, "t1": 10.97, "shot": "capcut", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$400,000", "label": "Reduction in the contract ceiling"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.63, 1.34, 2.13, 2.41, 2.53, 3.29, 3.81, 4.21, 4.41, 4.69, 5.05, 5.51]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The incumbent earned the highest score from the airport panel.", "t0": 11.09, "t1": 14.11, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "867.33", "label": "Incumbent score out of 925"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.76, 1.02, 1.15, 1.48, 1.84, 2.02, 2.11, 2.54]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Its United States headquarters was in Georgia, a state on the City’s list.", "t0": 14.23, "t1": 18.46, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "airport-coverage", "kicker": "March 2022 list", "text": "Georgia", "mark": "Georgia"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.67, 1.06, 1.68, 1.86, 1.99, 2.62, 2.78, 3.12, 3.23, 3.35, 3.74]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The headquarters rule barred the award. Nobody protested the replacement selection.", "t0": 18.58, "t1": 23.17, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "airport-initial-resolution", "kicker": "April 29 notice", "text": "Without protest", "mark": "protest"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.73, 1.02, 1.42, 1.54, 2.16, 2.61, 3.15, 3.26, 3.88]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The replacement budgeted more positions and lower annual labor costs.", "t0": 23.39, "t1": 27.44, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "21 positions", "label": "Prior agreement 17.13 positions"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.72, 1.21, 1.44, 2.14, 2.39, 2.77, 3.17, 3.5]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The old rates included overhead. The new rates covered wages and benefits.", "t0": 27.56, "t1": 32.15, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "airport-analysis", "kicker": "July analysis", "text": "Labor costs", "mark": "Labor"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.42, 0.73, 1.22, 2.04, 2.25, 2.46, 2.79, 3.18, 3.72, 3.87]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The City repealed the state contracting restriction the following year.", "t0": 32.27, "t1": 35.83, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "repeal", "kicker": "2023 repeal", "text": "Chapter 12X", "mark": "12X"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.45, 0.88, 0.99, 1.32, 1.98, 2.55, 2.66, 3.15]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The airport added boarding bridges and later sought a new contractor.", "t0": 35.95, "t1": 39.86, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "2024", "label": "Expanded scope"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.68, 1.01, 1.39, 1.96, 2.21, 2.53, 2.8, 2.88, 3.07]}, {"scene": "v", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Two firms entered the next competition. The replacement firm scored highest.", "t0": 40.08, "t1": 44.53, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "509.52", "label": "Highest score after repeal"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.75, 1.06, 1.15, 1.42, 2.36, 2.55, 3.14, 3.45, 3.85]}, {"scene": "v", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Airport records show two baggage tracking measures fell below target.", "t0": 44.65, "t1": 48.57, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "97%", "label": "Tracking accuracy target"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.5, 0.96, 1.24, 1.48, 1.91, 2.35, 2.78, 3.04, 3.36]}, {"scene": "v", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Supervisors authorized a new five-year agreement worth up to thirty-eight million dollars.", "t0": 48.69, "t1": 53.82, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$38 million", "label": "Replacement contract ceiling"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.91, 1.48, 1.58, 1.8, 2.35, 2.87, 3.16, 3.31, 3.43, 4.06, 4.49]}, {"scene": "v", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 53.94, "t1": 56.55, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.8, 0.97, 1.29, 1.39, 1.48, 1.78, 2.11]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"b": "Scores and eligibility", "c": "The contract and the repeal", "v": "Competition after repeal"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "question"}